      "created_at": "2012-08-21T18:29:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello All! First I want to say I'm new to the forums but I'm a big fan of the Sentinels of the Multiverse game, played it at it's grand apparence at GenCon and Wizard World Chicago Comic Con. Just wanted to announce that I'll be hosting Demos for this amazing game at Geek.Kon on Friday and Sunday. The convention is in good old Madison, Wisconsin and is going on from Sept 7-9.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm not sure what else to post in this event comment, but I'm excited to show off this game, I love it and people need to know about it. I just downloaded the card boxes and&nbsp;HP dial trackers a few minutes ago and can't wait to construct them.</p>",
